  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "于公于私的警告  (Wen Simo's Warning)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After waiting outside the studio all afternoon until everyone else has left, Wen Simo confronts Chun Yuqiao face to face about Xin Huimei. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我在这儿等了你一下午。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "直到其他人都走了，我才过来找你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你在那个演播室里，待得可真够久的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你有话要跟我说吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美是我最欣赏，也最珍惜的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果你以任何方式，让她受到任何伤害，我绝不答应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "那么我闻思默于公于私，都将会成为你最坚决的敌人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢你告诉我这些，现在我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "惠美是个从来不轻易喜欢别人的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚才她亲口告诉我她喜欢我，这说明她是真心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你知道什么是真心吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我在这儿等了你一下午。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have been waiting for you here all afternoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "直到其他人都走了，我才过来找你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only after everyone else left did I come over to find you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你在那个演播室里，待得可真够久的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You certainly stayed inside that studio for a long time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你有话要跟我说吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have something to say to me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美是我最欣赏，也最珍惜的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei is the woman I admire and cherish most.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果你以任何方式，让她受到任何伤害，我绝不答应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you cause her any harm in any way at all, I will never stand for it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "那么我闻思默于公于私，都将会成为你最坚决的敌人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then professionally and personally, I, Wen Simo, will become your most resolute enemy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢你告诉我这些，现在我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for telling me all this; now I understand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "惠美是个从来不轻易喜欢别人的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei is someone who never easily falls for anyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚才她亲口告诉我她喜欢我，这说明她是真心的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just now she told me herself that she likes me, which shows she is sincere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你知道什么是真心吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you even know what sincerity means?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我在这儿等了你一下午。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
